label "Dual-LLM pattern diagram"
canvas 460 270
box user 14 116 80 50 "user"
box priv 150 16 160 50 "privileged LLM|plans, chooses actions" acc
box ctrl 150 116 160 50 "controller (code)|holds $VAR1, $VAR2"
box tools 366 116 80 50 "tools|email, web"
box quar 150 196 160 46 "quarantined LLM|no tools"
arrow user ctrl both
arrow priv ctrl both
arrow ctrl tools both
arrow ctrl quar both
text 238 96 "variable names only" size=10 left
text 238 186 "untrusted text in" size=10 left
text 338 162 "untrusted" size=10
note "the privileged LLM never reads untrusted text — only variable names"
